      "characterType": 1,
      "characterPos": 1,
      "choices": [],
      "nextLineId": "opening_09"
    },
    {
      "lineId": "opening_09",
      "speaker": "스폰지밥",
      "txt": "...오늘 첫 재판이라 너무 긴장해서...\n머릿속에 게살버거 밖에~...",
